  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Shrine — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you can utter an incantation to create an arrow of fire. As an action, you can spend Cursed Energy up to twice your proficiency bonus, choosing a point within 150/600 feet of you. Each creature within 15 ft of that point must make a Dexterity saving throw, which is made at advantage if the creature is more than 150 feet away. On a failed save, they take a d12 of fire damage for each cursed energy spent. On a successful save, they take half as much damage.</p>",
